    "Hold L1 (PS5) / LB (Xbox) and press R1 (RB).",
    "Enter the cheat's D-pad arrow sequence while still holding. Arrows are identical on both consoles.",
    "Warning: any cheat disables saving and trophies/achievements for the rest of that play session."
